Yeah. A graft can bear fruit on a tree that spent years growing roots. That’s a better model for bringing back new relationship energy than trying to recreate the first date. You can dress up and meet your wife somewhere as if you’re courting her, and she can catch your eye from across the room with a look only the two of you understand. The years together are part of what makes that moment possible.

It’s the same thing you spotted in the jacket. The cloth stays the same. It gets a new life because of what you attach it to.